A quote is reached by its marker, and a column never reaches into one

```
> - x
  [r]: /url

See [r][].
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>x
[r]: /url</li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p>See [r][].</p>
```

```
- > - x
    [r]: /url

See [r][].
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <ul>
        <li>x</li>
      </ul>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>See <a href="/url">r</a>.</p>
```

```
> x
  [r]: /url

See [r][].
.
<blockquote><p>x
[r]: /url</p></blockquote>
<p>See [r][].</p>
```

```
> - x
>   [r]: /url

See [r][].
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>x</li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p>See <a href="/url">r</a>.</p>
```
